    <description>After start the engine gets a fuel enrichement depending on engine temp. and engine revolutions in table. The value is a factor applied to the injection time.&#013;&#010;Warm up period is finished after 2000 revolutions&#013;&#010;Warm up period is also viewable as &quot;unknown 1&quot;, value in Guzzidiag going from 5 to 7 in status field. 5 is during warm up time. 7 is normal running &#013;&#010;</description>
